<title>THAILAND: Thai banks, money market closed on Chakri Day.</title>
<headline>Thai banks, money market closed on Chakri Day.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai banks and money market were closed on Monday on an official substitute holiday to mark the Chakri Day in honour of the founder of Thailand's reigning royal dynasty.</p>
<p>Commercial banks and financial institutions will reopen on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Vithoon Amorn (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
